    The best solution isn't necessarily the most advanced one — it's the one
    that provides the right balance of availability, efficiency, scalability,
    and customer experience for your business.
faqs:
  - question: >-
      What is the difference between an AI call agent and a virtual
      receptionist?
    answer: >-
      An AI call agent uses artificial intelligence to answer and manage calls
      automatically, while a virtual receptionist is a real person who handles
      calls remotely.
  - question: >-
      Un service de permanence téléphonique IA est-il meilleur qu’un service
      traditionnel ?
    answer: >-
      An AI answering service can provide Disponibilité 24 h/24 et 7 j/7, handle
